# Water cation: unrestricted projection-free guess from the cc-pVTZ
# spin densities of H2O+_tz_hf in the aug-cc-pVDZ basis
System H2O.xyz
Method HF
Basis aug-cc-pVDZ
Direct false
IntegralThresh 1e-14
Charge 1
Multiplicity 2

LoadChk H2O+_tz_hf.chk
Guess ProjFree
Logfile H2O+_projfree_hf.log
SaveChk H2O+_projfree_hf.chk
BasisRotate false
